{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.QHeatEquationExists","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.QHeatEquationExists","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.QAnalysis"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QHeatEquation.exists_solution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QHeatEquation.exists_solution","kind":"theorem","line":20,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-heat-equation-exists.lean#L20-L35","doc":"**Well-posedness of the q-heat equation.**\n\nFor every slice type `S`, a `QHeatEquation S` instance exists —\nwitnessed by the formal semigroup `u(t) = exp(-t Δ_q) u₀`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:q-heat-equation-exists","label":"prop:q-heat-equation-exists","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-heat-equation-exists.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}